WEBVTT

00:14:55.371 --> 00:15:00.162
actions. You don't have to be an
advocate to to change the way

00:15:00.162 --> 00:15:03.204
a person sees the world or somebody else.

00:15:03.246 --> 00:15:04.954
But I think that if you are in

00:15:04.954 --> 00:15:08.496
a position where you see somebody
mistreating somebody else

00:15:08.496 --> 00:15:11.162
or you see somebody being disrespectful
to somebody else

00:15:11.371 --> 00:15:14.871
or you you hear somebody say something
that's maybe not even disrespectful to

00:15:14.871 --> 00:15:19.996
anybody who's in the room, but maybe
tell them, hey. Not cool.

00:15:20.662 --> 00:15:24.121
Have you considered this? Do you
realize that when you say this,

00:15:24.121 --> 00:15:29.162
you also mean this? That's one way, but
also than just modeling kindness?

00:15:29.871 --> 00:15:31.412
Like, again, it's super simple.